{"version":1,"content":"<p>【緊急要請 ⚠️】日本防災擔當大臣細野豪志 27 日於富士電視台新聞節目中，公開向全體國民發出緊急呼籲，促請每戶家庭即日起至少儲備 3 天、若情況允許應達 1 週的糧食、飲用水及應急物資，以應對可能發生的「國難級」重大災害。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:21:50.353153+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:11:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:12.863307+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.984441+00:00","content_hash":"b01e84850da92964a85d134b1633944b83f9f7e380605f88d74619d64fc36d2e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}